      <title>我国自研深水工程船交付，海洋装备再添利器</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260821/%E6%88%91%E5%9B%BD%E8%87%AA%E7%A0%94%E6%B7%B1%E6%B0%B4%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%E8%88%B9%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E6%B5%B7%E6%B4%8B%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%86%8D%E6%B7%BB%E5%88%A9%E5%99%A8/</link>
